  "claim": "borg_good_buy() (borg-store-buy.c:127-133 at e473720ed) applied the Black Market Rod of Teleport Other exception with != CLASS_MAGE && == CLASS_ROGUE, so only Rogues, who can cast Teleport Other, saved up for it. The correction uses != for both classes, as the Recall and Speed rod exceptions beside it do. Measured: a level-30 Warrior now sets the 15000 gold target and a Rogue no longer does; the Mage control is byte-identical. The purchase depends on #560 (the rod's value); stacked/ shows a level-12 Warrior with 16000 gold buying it with #560 and this correction, and not with #560 alone.",
